      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::rubric_card::000::16e383e6c2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS-based powder metallurgy can create a dense AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 coating on copper.",
