      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 800–900 °C, AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 HEA exhibits reduced wear depth relative to lower tested temperatures, with its highest measured wear resistance at 900 °C.",
